<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/styles/custom.css" />
  <title>ACH Bank Payment — JS SDK v6</title>
  <style>
    .page-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .page-header h1 { font-size: 2em; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #1a1a1a; }
    .page-header .badge-row { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .page-header p { color: #666; margin: 0; }

    .layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 360px;
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    @media (max-width: 800px) { .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    .product-card {
      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .product-card-inner { display: flex; gap: 0; }
    .product-image {
      width: 220px;
      min-width: 220px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-right: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    }
    .product-details { padding: 24px; flex: 1; }
    .product-details h2 { margin: 0 0 4px; color: #1a1a1a; font-size: 1.4em; }
    .product-details .category { font-size: 0.8em; color: #888; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .product-details .price { font-size: 1.6em; font-weight: 700; color: #0070ba; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .product-details p { color: #555; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .product-details ul { color: #555; font-size: 0.9em; padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; }
    .product-details ul li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .product-card-inner { flex-direction: column; }
      .product-image { width: 100%; min-width: unset; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; max-height: 200px; }
    }

    .checkout-panel {
      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #fff;
      position: sticky;
      top: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .checkout-panel-header {
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      background: #f8f9fa;
    }
    .checkout-panel-header h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1em; color: #333; font-weight: 600; }

    .order-summary { padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
    .summary-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 0.9em;
      color: #555;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .summary-row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .summary-row.total {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1em;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      padding-top: 8px;
      margin-top: 4px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    }
    .summary-item-name { color: #333; }
    .summary-qty { color: #888; font-size: 0.85em; margin-left: 4px; }

    .buttons-area { padding: 16px 20px; }

    .sdk-loading { text-align: center; padding: 16px 0; color: #888; font-size: 0.9em; }

    .status-area {
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.88em;
      display: none;
    }
    .status-area.info    { background: #e8f4fd; border: 1px solid #bee3f8; color: #2b6cb0; }
    .status-area.success { background: #f0fff4; border: 1px solid #9ae6b4; color: #276749; }
    .status-area.error   { background: #fff5f5; border: 1px solid #feb2b2; color: #c53030; }

    /* ACH bank button container */
    .ach-button-container {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .ach-button-container bank-payment-button {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .below-fold { margin-top: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }

    .requirements-banner {
      padding: 14px 18px;
      background: #fff8e1;
      border: 1px solid #ffe082;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.88em;
      color: #795548;
    }
    .requirements-banner strong { color: #5d4037; }
    .requirements-banner ul { margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 18px; }
    .requirements-banner ul li { margin-bottom: 3px; }

    .sandbox-note {
      padding: 12px 16px;
      background: #e8f5e9;
      border: 1px solid #a5d6a7;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.85em;
      color: #2e7d32;
    }
    .sandbox-note strong { color: #1b5e20; }

    .production-checklist { border: 1px solid #d6bcfa; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; }
    .production-checklist summary {
      padding: 14px 20px;
      background: #f5f0ff;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95em;
      color: #6f42c1;
      cursor: pointer;
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .production-checklist summary::after { content: '▼'; font-size: 0.75em; }
    .production-checklist[open] summary::after { content: '▲'; }
    .checklist-body { padding: 20px; background: #fff; }
    .checklist-body h4 { margin: 16px 0 8px; color: #444; font-size: 0.85em; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .checklist-body h4:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
    .checklist-body ul { margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 20px; }
    .checklist-body ul li { font-size: 0.9em; color: #555; margin-bottom: 4px; }

    .response-panel { border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; display: none; }
    .response-panel h3 { margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; background: #f8f9fa; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; font-size: 0.95em; color: #333; }
    .response-panel pre {
      margin: 0; padding: 16px 20px;
      background: #1e1e1e; color: #d4d4d4;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5;
      overflow: auto; max-height: 400px;
    }

    .back-link {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      color: #0070ba; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .back-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">

    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Dashboard</a>

    <div class="page-header">
      <div class="badge-row">
        <span class="sdk-badge js-sdk-v6">⬡ JS SDK v6</span>
        <span class="sdk-badge server-sdk">✓ Server SDK</span>
      </div>
      <h1>ACH Bank Payment</h1>
      <p>US bank transfer via PayPal's Open Banking layer — powered by Finicity (Mastercard). V6 SDK only.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Merchant requirements callout -->
    <div class="requirements-banner">
      <strong>Merchant provisioning required before this button renders.</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>US merchant + US buyer + USD transactions only</li>
        <li>PPCP / Unbranded product — requires Expanded Checkout approval</li>
        <li>Account must have <code>ACCEPT_PYMTS_VIA_ACH</code> feature + a 10-digit NACHA Company ID</li>
        <li>Onboarding via Partner Referrals API with <code>products["ach"]</code> — not self-serve</li>
        <li>V6 SDK component: <code>bankAchPayments</code> (sourced from internal altpay docs — not listed in public developer.paypal.com docs)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Unconfirmed API surface warning -->
    <div style="padding:12px 16px; background:#fff3e0; border:1px solid #ffb74d; border-radius:8px; font-size:0.85em; color:#e65100; margin-bottom:24px;">
      <strong>Component name unconfirmed from public docs.</strong>
      The <code>bank-ach-payments</code> component and <code>bank-payment-button</code> web component used here are derived from internal PayPal altpay documentation —
      they do not appear in the public <a href="https://developer.paypal.com/docs/checkout/advanced/sdk/v6/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">JS SDK v6 reference</a>.
      The button will only render if your merchant account is provisioned for ACH <em>and</em> the component name matches the internal SDK build on your account.
      Confirm the exact component name with the PayPal altpay team before relying on this integration.
    </div>

    <div class="layout">

      <!-- Left: product -->
      <div class="product-card">
        <div class="product-card-inner">
          <img
            class="product-image"
            src="https://media.istockphoto.com/id/508179654/photo/wooden-bowl-isolated-on-white-background.jpg?s=612x612&w=0&k=20&c=c5BqYjY0wgzjMsWsUlj_9uFpi4kT9YWO-_ZKZg4uoxY="
            alt="Wooden Bowl"
          />
          <div class="product-details">
            <div class="category">Home &amp; Kitchen</div>
            <h2>Wooden Bowl</h2>
            <div class="price">$50.00</div>
            <p>
              Handcrafted from sustainably sourced hardwood, showcasing unique grain
              patterns and rich colors that make every piece one-of-a-kind.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Food-safe, eco-friendly finish</li>
              <li>12" diameter × 4" height</li>
              <li>Hand wash recommended</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: checkout panel -->
      <div class="checkout-panel">
        <div class="checkout-panel-header">
          <h2>Order Summary</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="order-summary">
          <div class="summary-row">
            <span class="summary-item-name">Wooden Bowl <span class="summary-qty">× 1</span></span>
            <span>$50.00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="summary-row">
            <span>Shipping</span>
            <span>Free</span>
          </div>
          <div class="summary-row total">
            <span>Total</span>
            <span>$50.00 USD</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="buttons-area">
          <div id="sdk-loading" class="sdk-loading">Loading ACH payment method…</div>

          <div class="ach-button-container">
            <bank-payment-button id="ach-button" hidden></bank-payment-button>
          </div>

          <div id="status-area" class="status-area"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Below-fold: sandbox note, go-live checklist, API response -->
    <div class="below-fold">

      <div class="sandbox-note">
        <strong>Sandbox testing:</strong> Finicity (the production bank-link provider) is not available in sandbox.
        PayPal uses <strong>Yodlee</strong> for sandbox ACH testing. Use Yodlee test credentials when the bank-link
        UI appears to simulate a successful bank connection.
      </div>

      <details class="production-checklist">
        <summary>Production Go-Live Checklist</summary>
        <div class="checklist-body">
          <h4>Merchant Account</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Expanded Checkout approval granted by PayPal account team</li>
            <li><code>ACCEPT_PYMTS_VIA_ACH</code> feature provisioned on the merchant account</li>
            <li>10-digit NACHA Company ID configured in account settings</li>
            <li>Onboarded via Partner Referrals API with <code>products["ach"]</code></li>
          </ul>
          <h4>SDK Configuration</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Replace sandbox SDK URL with production: <code>https://www.paypal.com/web-sdk/v6/core</code></li>
            <li>Replace sandbox <code>clientId</code> with live credentials</li>
            <li>Ensure <code>bankAchPayments</code> is in the <code>components</code> array passed to <code>createInstance()</code></li>
            <li>Call <code>findEligibleMethods()</code> and check <code>isEligible('ach')</code> before rendering the button</li>
          </ul>
          <h4>ACH Limits</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Per-transaction ACH limit tiers: $10k / $99k (dynamic, enforced by RALS/RADD)</li>
            <li>Check eligibility before rendering — the SDK performs an ACH limit check automatically (Phase 2, live Oct 29 2025)</li>
            <li>Display a clear fallback payment option if ACH is ineligible for a given transaction amount</li>
          </ul>
          <h4>Open Banking / Bank-Link Flow</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>The Finicity bank-link UI is client-side only — no server SDK equivalent for this step</li>
            <li>Server SDK (or Orders v2 REST API directly) handles order create &amp; capture bookends</li>
            <li>Vault without purchase and one-time purchase are GA; vault with purchase — confirm current status with altpay team</li>
          </ul>
          <h4>Error Handling &amp; Webhooks</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Handle <code>onApprove</code>, <code>onCancel</code>, and <code>onError</code> callbacks</li>
            <li>ACH payments can take 1–3 business days to settle — do not fulfill immediately on capture</li>
            <li>Configure <code>PAYMENT.CAPTURE.COMPLETED</code> and <code>PAYMENT.CAPTURE.DENIED</code> webhooks</li>
            <li>Handle ACH returns (NSF, account closed) via <code>PAYMENT.CAPTURE.REVERSED</code> webhook</li>
          </ul>
          <h4>Environment</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>ACH is US-only — confirm buyer is US-based before showing the button</li>
            <li>Transactions must be USD</li>
            <li>Update server-side API base URL to <code>https://api-m.paypal.com</code></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </details>

      <div id="response-panel" class="response-panel">
        <h3>API Response</h3>
        <pre id="response-content"></pre>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- JS SDK v6 (sandbox) — bankAchPayments component -->
  <script src="https://www.sandbox.paypal.com/web-sdk/v6/core"></script>

  <script>
    const CLIENT_ID = '<%= clientId %>';
  </script>
  <script src="/ach.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
